THE PATTERN, NOW FIVE FOR FIVE
-------------------------------
Every defect fixed in this session had a passing test guaranteeing it:

    the isatty gate                  test_the_off_reason_names_a_pipe
    the two-signal read limit        test_each_level_fires_once_...
    the thirty-name tool dump        test_an_unknown_tool_is_answered_...
    the "nothing is lost" sentence   test_the_oversize_refusal_names_...
    `a` means deny                   test_ask_approval_menu_a_remembers_...

Each asserted the MECHANISM rather than the property it was supposed to
protect, so none could detect that the mechanism was the wrong one. All
repointed, none deleted.


